{
  "id": 204105399,
  "iid": 9731,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "CoAP: fix CoAP dissectors",
  "description": "This MR fixes the header field problems introduced by !9692 and refactors some of the code for handling Q-Block options. I now performed a more thorough manual testing procedure to ensure that the MR fixes all problems previously caused and that the new options are handled appropriately.\n\nThere is still some work to do: The preference for disabling vendor-specific or private options in the IANA registry (as suggested by @stigbjorlykke in !9692) is not implemented yet. Furthermore, the Q-Block option support is still only rudimentary and needs to take some additional assertions from RFC 9177 into account (especially those that prohibit a parallel usage of Block and Q-Block options). I would try to address these issues in follow-up MRs (probably next week).\n\nEdit: As suggested by @stigbjorlykke, I removed the code related to the Q-Block options and will open a separate MR for it.",
  "state": "merged",
